 and maybe even befriend an elf! <i>(If you really want to...)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to be emergent: All aspects of the game interacts with each other meaning that anything can happen with the correct combination of balls/relics/events/enemies/etc...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["YETIBYTES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634710/03ce311bd5fb7741e643ee191b01e071846969ca/header.jpg?t=1774289997","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 700 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3634710/880056/44d8c8989c5a893986cc7ce4ac6c2a61fe4bf86d/1750407345/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746261904","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3634710/880056/44d8c8989c5a893986cc7ce4ac6c2a61fe4bf86d/1750407345/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746261904","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3634710/880056/44d8c8989c5a893986cc7ce4ac6c2a61fe4bf86d/1750407345/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746261904","id":257132204,"name":"ANNOUNCEMENT TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132204/8288099aecda3eda0a07ab1a864088e620f474c4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746261904"}],"name":"DWARRF: A Pinball Roguelike","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeFo