' and set sail on your modified minecart into the depths of the mines. Fight enemies in a unique blend of Pinball, Pachinko, and Bubble Shooter whilst collecting game altering balls &amp; relics that ensure no two runs are alike.","steam_appid":3634710,"support_info":{"email":"contact@yetibytes.com","url":"http://www.yetibytes.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Thai, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Turkish, Ukrainian","type":"game","website":"https://yetibytes.com"}